{"title":"2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> represents a rectangular field. There are three flagpoles: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />. Paul runs along the path <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/6/fe68ac3de642bf43bab0b8fc4fc96cb2bb6a293a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A \\to D \\to C \\to M \\to A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"192\" height=\"14\" />. Tyler runs along the path <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/9/2696f38503399e61f53d67422764517fa91edc78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A \\to P \\to Q \\to C \\to B \\to A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"228\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a\" title=\"2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2a\">2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2a</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2b\" title=\"2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2b\">2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2b</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2c\" title=\"2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2c\">2018 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2c</a></li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018005300\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 64/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 407/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nU